Variable router:
- define all catalog endpoints under /api/v1/catalog

Function get_current_catalog_version:
- resolve the active data version
- return current version metadata with request_id

Function list_catalog_versions:
- list known data versions, optionally only the active one

Function list_champions:
- list champion DTOs for one game and one data version

Function list_items:
- list item DTOs for one game and one data version

Function list_runes:
- list rune DTOs for one game and one data version

Function lookup_catalog:
- validate non-empty q
- search the in-memory catalog index
- return localized lightweight lookup results
